      "writtenOn": "2022-12-15T19:32:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Would the Android TV, Android Auto and watch teams agree if I ask them? To me it seems more likely that it is needed for phones and tablets, but not some of the other verticals. For Android 13, we can go with built-in, but in Android 14, I suspect GKI module is the way to go.",
      "parentUuid": "f3c6bbcc_e5ea76ce",
      "revId": "04019cb610c69086e74568fed3112147360d1824",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
